- @page_title = "Action Pricing"

%h1= @page_title

.darkModule.block
  %p
    As you can imagine, managing thousands of development machines in the cloud is very expensive. During our private alpha, we'll be selecting a small group of developers to bang away on our platform.
  %p
    Once we've ironed out the major issues and learned how to keep our costs under control, we'll be opening up a private beta.
  %p
    We want to try to keep the cost to develop on Action manageable. With that in mind, we're waiting to set our pricing model until after our private alpha. The service will be free for a limited time for private alpha members, and then we will phase in premium plans.
  %p
    If you have any questions with regards to pricing, don't hesitate to
    %a{:href => "mailto: hello@action.io" }contact us
    ="."
%br
%p.alert.alert-notice
  Hey! Want to help us improve (and maybe get an early invite?)
